<p>Beemar chhod de..(2)<br> raahe pidar ki dekhna beemar chhod de..(2)</p> 
<p>chaukhat pe aake baithna beemar chhod de<br> raahe pidar ki dekhna beemar chhod de<br> beemar chhod de..</p> 
<p>1. Dehleez par jo aate hai, hai taaer lahu mai tarr<br> aati hai jinke paas se sughra bu e padar<br> kya hai sabab ye puchna, beemar chhod de..</p> 
<p>2. Hai sar bureeda laashe, nahi koi ab tera<br> akbar tadap tadap ke sare dasht mar gaya<br> sehre ke khwaab dekhna, beemar chhod de..</p> 
<p>3. Asghar ki yaad sughra, tujhe khoo'n rulaegi<br> kurta lahu bhara hua maa leke aaegi<br> jhule ke paas baithna, beemar chhod de..</p> 
<p>4. Aangan me khelta na, sakina ko paogi<br> godi me kisko leke kahani sunaogi<br> raunak wo ghar ki sochna, beemar chhod de..</p> 
<p>5. Qabr e nabi larazti, hai sunkar ye tere bayn<br> naize pe khoon rota hai sughra sare husain<br> baba ko yu pukarna, beemar chhod de..</p> 
<p>6. Kooze me kyu ye chehra e asghar jhalakta hai<br> jab naam lu sakina ka pani chalakta hai<br> aise sawaal puchna, beemar chhod de..</p> 
<p>7. Aaega khoo'n me dooba, alamdaar ka alam<br> abbas seh na paae sakina ka tha wo ghum<br> wo haath sar pe sochna, beemar chhod de..</p> 
<p>8. Masnad pe kaun baithega, aakar puphi ke saath<br> kiske liye bichai hai bibi ye janamaaz<br> hujre ko yu sawarna, beemar chhod de..</p> 
<p>9. Abid ki khoon roti, hui chashme ghum samar<br> kehti thi haaye dasht me maare gaye padar<br> raato ko uthke dhoondhna, beemar chhod de..</p> 
<p>raahe pidar ki dekhna beemar chhod de..(2)<br> beemar chhod de..(2)</p>